desc="Rockstar has not announced a PC version of GTA 6, so DLSS and FSR support is not confirmed. But GTA 5 Enhanced, Rockstar's most recent PC release, shipped with Nvidia DLSS 3, AMD FSR 1 and 3, and Intel XeSS. That is the best evidence for what GTA 6 on PC will offer.",
