lede="Nobody can confirm DLSS or FSR support for GTA 6 on PC yet, because Rockstar has not announced a PC version at all. The best evidence is Rockstar's most recent PC release. GTA 5 Enhanced arrived on PC in March 2025 with Nvidia DLSS 3, AMD FSR 1 and 3, and Intel XeSS built in, and that tells us a lot about what to expect when GTA 6 eventually reaches PC.",
